---
// eric_portfolio.astro — hidden, no layout, noindex everywhere
// Do NOT link to this page from any nav, footer, or other page.
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex" />
<meta name="googlebot" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex" />
<meta name="bingbot" content="noindex, nofollow" />
<title>Eric Chan — Selected Work</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style is:global>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --black: #0A0A0A;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --cream: #F5F1EC;
    --mid: #6b6b6b;
    --faint: #b0b0b0;
    --border: #e0e0e0;
    --font-display: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
    --font-body: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  html {
    background: var(--white);
    color: var(--black);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  body {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 28px 8rem;
  }

  /* HEADER */
  .site-header {
    padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--black);
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .header-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mid);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .header-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 6vw, 56px);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.0;
    color: var(--black);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .header-role {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mid);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .header-bio {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--mid);
    max-width: 580px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* INDEX NAV */
  .index-nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .index-nav a {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mid);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 5px 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
  }

  .index-nav a:hover {
    color: var(--black);
    border-color: var(--black);
  }

  /* SECTIONS */
  .section {
    margin-bottom: 6rem;
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .section:last-of-type {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .section-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--faint);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 32px);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--black);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mid);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-rule {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--black);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .section-body {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--mid);
    line-height: 1.85;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  /* PROCESS TAGS */
  .process-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .process-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mid);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 4px 10px;
  }

  /* SCREENSHOT GRID */
  .screenshot-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .screenshot-card {
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .screenshot-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--black);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }

  .screenshot-card img { transition: transform 0.4s ease; }
  .screenshot-card:hover img { transform: scale(1.02); }

  .screenshot-img {
    height: 150px;
    background: var(--cream);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .screenshot-img span {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .screenshot-meta {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: var(--white);
  }

  .screenshot-meta strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--black);
  }

  .screenshot-meta span {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  /* EMBED ROW */
  .embed-row {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 14px 18px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    background: var(--cream);
  }

  .embed-icon {
    font-size: 18px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 28px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .embed-info strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--black);
  }

  .embed-info span {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--mid);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }

  .embed-badge {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mid);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 3px 10px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: var(--white);
  }

  /* RELEASE GRID */
  .release-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .release-card {
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .release-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }

  .release-art {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: var(--cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .release-card:hover .release-art { border-color: var(--black); }

  .release-art span {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--faint);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 8px;
  }

  .release-meta strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--black);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .release-meta span {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  /* STATS GRID */
  .stats-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border: 1px solid var(--black);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .stat-cell {
    padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    text-align: center;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .stat-cell:nth-child(3n) { border-right: none; }
  .stat-cell:nth-child(4), .stat-cell:nth-child(5), .stat-cell:nth-child(6) { border-bottom: none; }

  .stat-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 38px);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--black);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mid);
  }

  /* ROLE NOTE */
  .role-note {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--black);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--mid);
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-style: italic;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  /* HANDLE GRID */
  .handle-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .handle-item {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mid);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 9px 14px;
  }

  /* VIDEO EMBEDS (responsive 16:9) */
  .video-wrap {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 56.25%;
    height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .video-wrap iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
  }

  .embed-brand-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 14px;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .yt-brand {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--black);
  }
  .yt-brand-detail {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--mid);
  }

  /* CONTACT */
  .contact-section {
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }

  .contact-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--faint);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .contact-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 28px);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--black);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .contact-rule {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--black);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .contact-body {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--mid);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .contact-link {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--black);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    width: fit-content;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .contact-link:hover { border-color: var(--black); }

  /* SMALL SECTION LABEL */
  .sub-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--faint);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .screenshot-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .stat-cell:nth-child(3n) { border-right: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .stat-cell:nth-child(2n) { border-right: none; }
    .handle-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .release-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HEADER -->
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="header-eyebrow">Portfolio · Private</div>
  <h1 class="header-name">Eric M.Y. Chan</h1>
  <div class="header-role">Creative Producer · Music · Multimedia · Live Production</div>
  <p class="header-bio">Selected work across creative production, music, multimedia, editorial content and live entertainment. A lot of my work sits between the creative idea and getting it made — bringing together artists, creative teams, technical teams and partners to take projects from planning through delivery.</p>
</header>

<!-- INDEX NAV -->
<nav class="index-nav" aria-label="Section index">
  <a href="#inlet-wire">01 Inlet Wire</a>
  <a href="#days-eye">02 Day's Eye Records</a>
  <a href="#galaxy">03 Galaxy Entertainment Group</a>
  <a href="#branded">04 Commercial & Branded Content</a>
  <a href="#audio">05 Audio Engineering</a>
  <a href="#ftg">06 Forget the G</a>
  <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<!-- 01 INLET WIRE -->
<section class="section" id="inlet-wire">
  <div class="section-num">01</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Inlet Wire</h2>
  <div class="section-subtitle">Editorial & Digital Production</div>
  <hr class="section-rule" />
  <p class="section-body">Inlet Wire is my BC music podcast and media platform. I host and produce every episode — from artist research and outreach through interview planning, recording, audio editing, narration, artwork, publishing and promotion. I also developed the brand, website and editorial structure around the series. Each episode is shaped through narration that bridges the conversation, guiding listeners through the dialogue without overriding the guest's voice.</p>

  <div class="process-list">
    <span class="process-tag">Artist research</span>
    <span class="process-tag">Outreach</span>
    <span class="process-tag">Interview planning</span>
    <span class="process-tag">Recording</span>
    <span class="process-tag">Audio editing</span>
    <span class="process-tag">Narration</span>
    <span class="process-tag">Editorial</span>
    <span class="process-tag">Artwork</span>
    <span class="process-tag">Publishing</span>
    <span class="process-tag">Social content</span>
    <span class="process-tag">Multi-platform distribution</span>
    <span class="process-tag">Platform management</span>
  </div>

  <div class="screenshot-grid">
    <a href="https://inletwire.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="screenshot-card">
      <div class="screenshot-img" style="padding:0; overflow:hidden;">
        <img src="/images/portfolio/screenshot-home.png" alt="Inlet Wire — home page" width="1200" height="750" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="screenshot-meta">
        <strong>Inlet Wire</strong>
        <span>Brand & homepage</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a href="https://inletwire.com/episodes/leah-abramson/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="screenshot-card">
      <div class="screenshot-img" style="padding:0; overflow:hidden;">
        <img src="/images/portfolio/screenshot-episodes.png" alt="Inlet Wire — episode page" width="1200" height="750" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="screenshot-meta">
        <strong>Episode Archive</strong>
        <span>Editorial & publishing</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>

  <iframe src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/playlist/1De8QSqbYa15p5gXO78PDl?utm_source=generator" width="100%" height="380" frameborder="0"
    allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
    loading="lazy"
    style="display:block; border-radius:8px; margin-bottom:8px;"></iframe>
</section>

<!-- 02 DAY'S EYE RECORDS -->
<section class="section" id="days-eye">
  <div class="section-num">02</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Day's Eye Records</h2>
  <div class="section-subtitle">Music Production · Releases · Licensing · International Projects</div>
  <hr class="section-rule" />
  <p class="section-body">Day's Eye Records is an independent record label I founded in 2009. I work directly with artists across production, releases, licensing, publishing and international projects — from early planning through production and release.</p>

  <div class="sub-label">Selected Releases</div>
  <div class="release-grid">
    <a href="https://dayseyerecords.com/releases/downer-topsy-wave-fragments" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="release-card">
      <div class="release-art" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden;">
        <img src="https://dayseyerecords.com/covers/downer-topsy-wave-fragments-1200.jpg" alt="Downer / Topsy Wave — Fragments" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy" onerror="this.parentElement.innerHTML='<span>Fragments · 2026</span>'" />
      </div>
      <div class="release-meta"><strong>Downer / Topsy Wave</strong><span>Fragments · 2026</span></div>
    </a>
    <a href="https://dayseyerecords.com/releases/maenad-and-the-ravers-spellbreak" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="release-card">
      <div class="release-art" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden;">
        <img src="https://dayseyerecords.com/covers/maenad-and-the-ravers-spellbreak-1200.jpg" alt="Maenad & the Ravers — SPELLBREAK" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy" onerror="this.parentElement.innerHTML='<span>SPELLBREAK · 2025</span>'" />
      </div>
      <div class="release-meta"><strong>Maenad & the Ravers</strong><span>SPELLBREAK · 2025</span></div>
    </a>
    <a href="https://dayseyerecords.com/releases/heresy-reincarnation" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="release-card">
      <div class="release-art" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden;">
        <img src="https://dayseyerecords.com/covers/heresy-reincarnation-1200.jpg" alt="Heresy — Reincarnation" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy" onerror="this.parentElement.innerHTML='<span>Reincarnation · 2023</span>'" />
      </div>
      <div class="release-meta"><strong>Heresy</strong><span>Reincarnation · 2023</span></div>
    </a>
    <a href="https://dayseyerecords.com/releases/forget-the-g-doomsday-lovesongs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="release-card">
      <div class="release-art" style="padding:0;overflow:hidden;">
        <img src="https://dayseyerecords.com/covers/forget-the-g-doomsday-lovesongs-1200.jpg" alt="Forget the G — Doomsday Lovesongs" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy" onerror="this.parentElement.innerHTML='<span>Doomsday Lovesongs · 2020</span>'" />
      </div>
      <div class="release-meta"><strong>Forget the G</strong><span>Doomsday Lovesongs · 2020</span></div>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="sub-label" style="margin-top: 0;">What I Handle</div>
  <div class="handle-grid">
    <div class="handle-item">Creative & release planning</div>
    <div class="handle-item">Music production</div>
    <div class="handle-item">Artist coordination</div>
    <div class="handle-item">Licensing & publishing</div>
    <div class="handle-item">Manufacturing & distribution</div>
    <div class="handle-item">International booking</div>
    <div class="handle-item">Promoter / venue coordination</div>
    <div class="handle-item">Festival coordination</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 03 GALAXY ENTERTAINMENT GROUP -->
<section class="section" id="galaxy">
  <div class="section-num">03</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Galaxy Entertainment Group</h2>
  <div class="section-subtitle">Multimedia · Live Production · Broadcast</div>
  <hr class="section-rule" />
  <p class="section-body">At Galaxy Entertainment Group, I led a 60+ person technical and multimedia team supporting three properties and 18 venues. My role covered live production, multimedia, broadcast, production planning, budgets and CAPEX.</p>
  <p class="section-body" style="margin-top:-1rem; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.04em;">Senior Technical Manager, Entertainment — Marketing Division &nbsp;·&nbsp; Macau &nbsp;·&nbsp; 2006–2019</p>

  <div class="stats-grid">
    <div class="stat-cell">
      <div class="stat-num">60+</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Team</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-cell">
      <div class="stat-num">3</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Properties</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-cell">
      <div class="stat-num">18</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Venues</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-cell">
      <div class="stat-num">10–15</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Live events / day</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-cell">
      <div class="stat-num">40–50</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Multimedia projects / yr</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-cell">
      <div class="stat-num">13</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Years at Galaxy</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="role-note">
    I led the teams and oversaw the production process, making sure the creative, technical, staffing, scheduling and budget sides all worked together and projects were delivered smoothly.
  </div>

  <div class="handle-grid">
    <div class="handle-item">Audio</div>
    <div class="handle-item">Lighting</div>
    <div class="handle-item">Stage</div>
    <div class="handle-item">Multimedia production</div>
    <div class="handle-item">Video & broadcast</div>
    <div class="handle-item">Promotional content</div>
    <div class="handle-item">Production planning</div>
    <div class="handle-item">Budgets & CAPEX</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 04 COMMERCIAL & BRANDED CONTENT -->
